"General Hsiang Ch'ung is even in temper and conduct and thoroughly versed in military affairs.": "9c39ddf69e89",
"General Hsiang Ch'ung is even in temper and conduct and thoroughly versed in military affairs; tried out in former days, the late Emperor called him able, and so the assembly raised him to be commander.": "e9941768e6e0",
"He came three times to my thatched hut to consult me on the affairs of the age.": "54077fc2066b",
