"If anyone does evil and breaks the law, or acts with loyalty and goodness, he should be handed to the proper officers to determine his punishment or reward,": "24de704ba206",
"If no word comes forward that advances virtue, then blame Yu-chih, I and Yün for negligence and make their fault plain.": "4e67e2c4842c",
"In my foolish view, in camp matters you should consult him in everything; this will surely keep the ranks in harmony and put the abler and the weaker each in their place.": "e9f33afb0584",
