"The attendants and gentlemen-in-waiting Kuo Yu-chih, Fei I and Tung Yün are all good and solid men, loyal and pure in thought; that is why the late Emperor picked them out and left them to Your Majesty.": "f23b216ded90",
"The attendants, the secretaries, the chief clerk and the staff officer are all men of integrity who would die at their post. I hope Your Majesty will keep them close and trust them; then the rise of the House of Han may be counted in days.": "b3b0e28bc488",
"The attendants, the secretaries, the chief clerk and the staff officer are all men of integrity.": "f94db27cb570",
